    "q-71403": {
      "dom_id": "step-q71403",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "For the function $f(x,y,z)=\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}$, find a vector that's perpendicular to the level surface that passes through the point where $(x,y,z)=(3,4,0).$",
      "worked_solution": "A normal vector to the level surface that passes through the point where $(x,y,z)=(3,4,0)$ can be found by computing \n$∇f(3,4,0).$ \n\nSo, we first find the gradient and evaluate it at $(x,y,z)=(3,4,0):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}∇f(x,y,z) & ={f}_{x}(x,y,z)\\,i+{f}_{y}(x,y,z)\\text{ }j+{f}_{z}(x,y,z)\\text{ }k \\\\  & =\\frac{∂}{∂x}(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}})\\,i+\\frac{∂}{∂y}(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}})\\,j+\\frac{∂}{∂z}(\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}})\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}}\\text{ }i+\\frac{y}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}}\\text{ }j+\\frac{z}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}+{z}^{2}}}\\text{ }k \\\\ ∇f(3,4,0) & =\\frac{3}{\\sqrt{(3)^{2}+(4)^{2}+(0)^{2}}}\\,i+\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{(3)^{2}+(4)^{2}+(0)^{2}}}\\,j+\\frac{0}{\\sqrt{(3)^{2}+(4)^{2}+(0)^{2}}}\\,k \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{5}\\,i+\\frac{4}{5}\\,j\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\frac{3}{5}\\,i+\\frac{4}{5}\\,j$ is perpendicular to the level surface that passes through the point where $(x,y,z)=(3,4,0).$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-71403-a",
              "type": "math",
              "value": "i+j",
              "html": "<mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"21\" style=\"font-size: 119.6%; position: relative;\"><mjx-math class=\"MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-texatom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D422 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-texatom space=\"3\" texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D423 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-texatom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">i</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">j</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container>"
            },
            {
              "option": "b",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-71403-b",
